# A whole day on the desk, on USB: night, a dark morning, daylight, the
# owner away at work, an evening of play, lights out. Runs ~20-30 min.
duration 24:00:00
clock 00:00
sunrise 07:45
sunset 19:30
seed 3
room_light off
window 170 20 40 30
lamp desk 100 12 off
owner home

# night: expected still and quiet; a noise at 3 am
at 3:12:00 clap 150 0.6
# morning
at 6:50:00 lamp desk on
at 7:05:00 room_light on
at 7:10:00 person alex enter -40 1.5
at 7:12:00 talk -40 3
at 7:15:00 pet 1200
at 7:30:00 tap_screen
at 8:10:00 person alex leave
at 8:15:00 room_light off
at 8:20:00 owner away
# alone all day; the lamp stays on
at 12:00:00 noise 60
at 12:30:00 noise 0
at 13:00:00 lamp desk off
# evening
at 18:05:00 owner home
at 18:10:00 room_light on
at 18:12:00 person alex enter 30 1.5
at 18:13:00 talk 30 4
at 18:20:00 pet 1500
at 18:22:00 double_tap_screen
every 0:05:00 from 18:30:00 until 20:30:00 touch_head 400
at 19:00:00 clap -70
at 20:45:00 person alex leave
at 21:30:00 lamp desk on
at 22:30:00 room_light off
at 22:40:00 lamp desk off
